const cpblTeamByClub={"owls":"中信兄弟","foxes":"味全龍","falcons":"統一7-ELEVEn獅","mariners":"富邦悍將","wolves":"樂天桃猿","comets":"台鋼雄鷹"};
function mergeBulkPitching2026(player,league,club){
 const key=league==='cpbl'?cpblTeamByClub[club]+'/'+player.name.normalize('NFKC').replace(/\s/g,'').replace(/髙/g,'高').replace(/﨑/g,'崎'):player.id;
 const e=bulkPitching2026[league]?.[key]||window.NightPitchExpansion2026?.evidence?.[league]?.[key];
 if(!e||e.name!==player.name)return player;
 const p={...player,pitches:[...player.pitches],pitchDetails:{...player.pitchDetails},velocityEvidence:{...player.velocityEvidence},estimates:[...(player.estimates||[])]};
 const d=e.details,old=p.pitchDetails;
 const full=league==='npb'&&e.sampleCount>=40&&d.fast&&Object.keys(d).length>=2;
 if(full){
  // Exclude single-pitch classification noise from the selectable repertoire, but retain it in observed evidence.
  p.pitches=Object.keys(d).filter(id=>id==='fast'||d[id].pitches>=3);
  if(p.pitches.length<2)p.pitches=Object.keys(d);
  p.pitches.sort((a,b)=>a==='fast'?-1:b==='fast'?1:(d[b].usage||0)-(d[a].usage||0));
  p.pitchDetails={};
  p.estimates=p.estimates.filter(x=>x!=='pitchRepertoire');
  p.velocityEvidence.repertoireEstimated=false;
 }else{
  for(const id of Object.keys(d))if(!p.pitches.includes(id))p.pitches.push(id);
 }
 for(const id of p.pitches){
  if(d[id])p.pitchDetails[id]={...old[id],breakScale:old[id]?.breakScale||1,...d[id]};
  else if(full)delete p.pitchDetails[id];
  else if(d.fast&&p.pitchDetails[id]&&!Number.isFinite(p.pitchDetails[id].measuredAverage)&&/推定/.test(p.pitchDetails[id].speedBasis||'')){
   p.pitchDetails[id]={...p.pitchDetails[id],speed:Math.round(d.fast.speed*(ratios2026[id]||.9)*10)/10};
  }
 }
 if(d.fast){
  p.velocity=Math.round(d.fast.speed);p.speedEstimated=false;
  p.estimates=p.estimates.filter(x=>x!=='velocity');
  p.velocityEvidence={...p.velocityEvidence,fastAvg:d.fast.measuredAverage,fastAvgEstimated:false,fastMax:Number.isFinite(d.fast.measuredMax)?d.fast.measuredMax:(p.velocityEvidence.fastMax>=d.fast.speed?p.velocityEvidence.fastMax:null),fastSamples:d.fast.samples??null,speedBasis:d.fast.speedBasis,sourceUrl:d.fast.sourceUrl};
 }
 if(e.aggregate)p.velocityEvidence.trackingAggregate2026=e.aggregate;
 if(full&&p.pitches.every(id=>Number.isFinite(p.pitchDetails[id]?.measuredAverage)))p.estimates=p.estimates.filter(x=>x!=='individualPitchSpeed');
 else if(p.pitches.some(id=>!Number.isFinite(p.pitchDetails[id]?.measuredAverage))&&!p.estimates.includes('individualPitchSpeed'))p.estimates.push('individualPitchSpeed');
 p.pitchingEstimated=!!(p.speedEstimated||p.estimates.includes('pitchRepertoire')||p.estimates.includes('individualPitchSpeed'));
 p.pitchingEvidence2026={...p.pitchingEvidence2026,...e,avg:Object.fromEntries(Object.entries(d).map(([k,v])=>[k,v.measuredAverage])),max:Object.fromEntries(Object.entries(d).filter(([k,v])=>Number.isFinite(v.measuredMax)).map(([k,v])=>[k,v.measuredMax])),season:2026,partial:!full};
 return p;
}
function applyPitching2026(player,league){
 const key=league==='cpbl'?'cpbl:'+player.name:player.id;
 const e=pitching2026.pitchers[key];
 if(!e||e.name!==player.name)return player;
 const p={...player,pitches:[...player.pitches],pitchDetails:{...player.pitchDetails},velocityEvidence:{...player.velocityEvidence},estimates:[...(player.estimates||[])]};
 const avg=e.avg||{},max=e.max||{},previous=p.pitchDetails;
 const observed=[...new Set([...Object.keys(avg),...(e.observed||[])])];
 // Keep unverified existing choices unless we have a fully identified 2026
 // repertoire; a partial source must not erase other potentially valid pitches.
 const exact=league!=='cpbl'&&['npb-e-p6','npb-m-p-taneichi-2026','npb-b-p2'].includes(key);
 if(exact)p.pitches=observed;
 else for(const id of [...observed,...(e.historical||[])])if(!p.pitches.includes(id))p.pitches.push(id);
 if(!p.pitches.includes('fast'))p.pitches.unshift('fast');
 const fast=avg.fast??p.velocityEvidence.fastAvg??p.velocity;
 if(Number.isFinite(avg.fast)){
  p.velocity=Math.round(avg.fast);p.speedEstimated=false;
  p.estimates=p.estimates.filter(x=>x!=='velocity');
  p.velocityEvidence.fastAvg=avg.fast;p.velocityEvidence.fastAvgEstimated=false;
 }
 if(Number.isFinite(max.fast))p.velocityEvidence.fastMax=max.fast;
 for(const id of p.pitches){
  const old=previous[id]||{};
  const d={...old,breakScale:old.breakScale||1};
  if(Number.isFinite(avg[id])){
   d.speed=avg[id];d.measuredAverage=avg[id];d.speedBasis='2026年実測平均';d.sourceUrl=e.source;
  }else if(!Number.isFinite(d.speed)|| (Number.isFinite(avg.fast)&&/推定/.test(d.speedBasis||'')&&ratios2026[id])){
   d.speed=Math.round(fast*(ratios2026[id]||.9)*10)/10;d.speedBasis='ゲーム用推定';
  }
  if(Number.isFinite(max[id])){d.measuredMax=max[id];d.sourceUrl=e.source;}
  if(e.labels?.[id])d.label=e.labels[id];
  p.pitchDetails[id]=d;
 }
 if(exact){p.estimates=p.estimates.filter(x=>x!=='pitchRepertoire');p.velocityEvidence.repertoireEstimated=false;}
 else if(league!=='cpbl'&&!p.estimates.includes('pitchRepertoire'))p.estimates.push('pitchRepertoire');
 if(p.pitches.some(id=>!Number.isFinite(p.pitchDetails[id]?.measuredAverage))&&!p.estimates.includes('individualPitchSpeed'))p.estimates.push('individualPitchSpeed');
 if(e.aggregate)Object.assign(p.velocityEvidence,e.aggregate);
 p.velocityEvidence.sourceUrl=e.source;p.velocityEvidence.speedBasis=Number.isFinite(avg.fast)?'2026年実測平均（'+(e.scope||league.toUpperCase())+'）':p.velocityEvidence.speedBasis;
 p.pitchingEvidence2026={...e,season:2026,checked:pitching2026.checked,partial:!exact};
 p.pitchingEstimated=Boolean(p.speedEstimated||p.estimates.includes('pitchRepertoire')||p.estimates.includes('individualPitchSpeed'));
 return p;
}
function extraPitchers2026(club,existing,league){
 const current=new Set(existing.map(p=>p.id));
 const names=new Set(existing.map(p=>p.name.replace(/\s/g,'')));
 return [...(pitching2026.additions[club]||[]),...(window.NightPitchExpansion2026?.additions?.[club]||[])].filter(p=>!current.has(p.id)&&!names.has(p.name.replace(/\s/g,''))).map(p=>applyPitching2026(p,league));
}

for(const [club,identity]of Object.entries(data.identities)){
 const prefix=club==='owls'?'o':club==='foxes'?'f':null;
 const batters=identity.batters.map(([name,no,pos,hand],i)=>({id:prefix?prefix+(i+1):club+'-b'+(i+1),name,no,pos,hand,season:2026,...data.players[club][name]}));
 const pitchers=identity.pitchers.map(([name,no,hand],i)=>mergeBulkPitching2026(applyPitching2026({id:prefix?prefix+'p'+(i+1):club+'-p'+(i+1),name,no,hand,pos:'P',season:2026,...data.players[club][name]},'cpbl'),'cpbl',club));
 pitchers.push(...extraPitchers2026(club,pitchers,'cpbl').map(p=>mergeBulkPitching2026(p,'cpbl',club)));
 rosters[club]={batters,pitchers,startingOrder:batters.slice(0,9).map(p=>p.id),lineupDate:identity.date,rosterNote:identity.rosterNote};
}
